<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - People's Bank started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - People's Bank started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers Inc said it initiated coverage of People's Bank with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- said expects company to earn $2.25 a share in 1997 and $2.50 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- People's Bank remained unchanged at 31-1/4.</p>
</text>
